<title>USA: U.S.-SDR rate opener, weekly charge rates.</title>
<headline>U.S.-SDR rate opener, weekly charge rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the opening exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.39444, versus 1.38323 on Friday.</p>
<p>The IMF said that for the week beginning June 9, the rate of interest and charges on the SDR, the rate of remuneration on members' creditor positions and the rate of charge on members' use of fund credit were unavailable.</p>
